            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"f9437e4f-6ed3-40b5-9c17-2114ebd9c7c5\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"The cat slowly blinks and turns its head toward the window.\",\"model_prompt\":\"How the reference pictures align with the target video - <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) aligns with the 4.00-second mark of the target video.\\n\\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a close-up shot begins with the white cat positioned slightly away from the camera, facing forward with its eyes wide open and looking straight ahead, maintaining the same fluffy white fur, pink nose, and distinctive heterochromia with one green eye and one blue eye as seen in <Picture 1>. The camera holds a static shot as the cat slowly blinks its eyelids downward, then opens them while smoothly turning its head to the right toward an off-screen window, coming to a complete stop and settling into the exact head angle, eye gaze, lighting, and composition established by <Picture 1> at the end of the shot.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Soft cat purring accompanied by the faint rustle of fur and a gentle breeze blowing from the off-screen window.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":1546,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3-MultiMax\",\"task_type\":\"I2V\",\"seed\":634007,\"fps\":null,\"height\":480,\"width\":864,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":4.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/cat1.jpg\"],\"input_video_secs\":null,\"src_video_urls\":null,\"src_audio_urls\":null,\"src_file_urls\":null,\"src_webpage_urls\":null,\"acceleration\":null,\"adapter\":null,\"draft\":null,\"draft_source_task_id\":null},\"task_output\":null,\"moderation\":null}"
